The gate this row decomposes to holds an attended lane at every lane commit and at its landing.\n  - **Why it is clarity:** the edit removes that misreading without changing what the row obliges. No routing term, condition, actor or refusal is added or dropped, and every approved word is kept. An implementation correct under the blessed reading of the old text (routing at unattended integration, the hold wherever a claimed row is marked single) is correct under the new one, and the new text forbids nothing that reading allowed. No file or carrier is named.\n\nVERDICT: CLARITY rows=1\n\n**Aftermath:** the row keeps its attestation. This session re-anchors it on the released rung, in its own act commit:\n\n`python project-trajectory/scripts/intake.py snapshot --reattests SR-154`\n\nSITTING: JUDGED kinds=amendment\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1535,"cache_read_input_tokens":626327,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1535},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73ae5cf9-d335-4bb7-a08f-7631da597f26","uuid":"31dd750d-4952-4235-a905-2a803bd77559","timestamp":"2026-10-17T00:45:21.115Z","request_id":"req_011Cg6tGMJbkUaBt2Tbda1Sz","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01NEn1eHa5VunbEJhMYfUNUJ":{"file_path":"C:\\Projects\\ai-template.wt\\wi-922\\docs\\reviews\\wi-922\\004-ADJUDICATE-b358098.md","content":"# WI-922 adjudication 004: amendment of SR-154's Requirement\n\nI judged the one amended cell at `b35809891`. Since the anchor (`247dc36c4`), SR-154's `requirement` is the only line that moved in the SR registry. The SR rung is released (`human_approval_through = \"DevStg-Boundary\"`).\n\n## amendment\n\n- [CLARITY] SR-154 Requirement -> the delivered lo